msgstr "Gotowe, gdy wrócisz"

#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:6800
msgid ""
"After Windows, Monet starts your desktop behind the lock screen, so it's there as soon as you type your password."
msgstr ""
"Po Windows Monet uruchamia pulpit za ekranem blokady, więc jest gotowy, gdy tylko wpiszesz hasło."

#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:6815
msgid "Open your apps again"
msgstr "Otwórz aplikacje ponownie"

